# Cursor Rules for ScrapScrap

- You are working on ScrapScrap, an open-source local-first Google Maps and website email harvester.
- All core engine modules reside under `src/core/`.
- Local storage uses `src/data/store.js` (zero-compilation flat JSON).
- The Web UI runs via `src/ui/server.js` on port 3800.
- When creating or modifying UI components, maintain the Apple Design & Impeccable guidelines: ZERO emojis in UI code, use clean vector SVG icons, and use critically damped spring animations for sheets and drawers.
- Read `AGENTS.md` for CLI flags and programmatic APIs.
- Consult `ARCHITECTURE.md` for subsystem engineering details and `SECURITY.md` for SSRF boundaries.
